title: 'Decided: the view does not say whose overrides it follows.'
pid: aba644bc-91c7-4d6d-81b2-bf521648b482
body: |2-
  A substituted node already carries its home skgrepo's herald and the
  overridesHere mark, which together say whose version it is, and the
  root's own herald says whose view it is. Nothing new was drawn.
  Unsure: one's own fork, now invisible there, says nothing at all.
